* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* RMPROCRP - Process Source and create active Reports
*
* Maintenance:
* uuu yy-mm-dd s(999999) ....
* mrs 93-01-08           rewritten to process only one order
* mrs 93-10-06 s(172286) log separation exit usage
* mrs 93-10-26 s(172286) set STEPLIB implemented
* mrs 93-12-10 s(999999) read source if only if neccessary
* gw  95-02-06 s(999999) delete order if ar-create-ok
* mrs 95-11-27 s(999999) extended spool attributes
* gw  96-06-07 s(999999) extended spool attributes increased array dim.
* gw  96-07-18 p(155680) correct steplib handling
* jwo 97-06-10 p(162903) avoid multiple count orders for same file
* gw  98-05-14 p(168326) number of lines gt 9999999
* jvd 98-05-04 p(168326)  Increase display size to show lines > 10m
* jvd 98-09-10 p(164220) NOM141ÖNAT23
*                        p(168326) is now in p(164220)so I have removed
*                        all refferance to P(168326) to make easier
*                        reading
