* xsiszha 2000-07-31 (CE7461)  Extend Report and Bundle Names
* fhi     2000-08-24 QA03      Use NAT23006 for error values
* fhi     2000-12-20 s(204275) Wrong records in REPORT-CONTENS, rep. mis
